      "writtenOn": "2024-12-11T15:00:11Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, if there is a name clash for validators (e.g. if you register the same validator multiple time) this fails. Actually it will trigger an exeption, since ImmutableMap.Builder#build throws if you have added multiple entries with the same key to it.\n\nI think this limitation is fine, since currently don\u0027t have a use case for registering the same validator twice.",
